<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>The American Dream and Other Fairy Tales - Poster</title>
<script type="text/javascript" id="MathJax-script" async
  src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js">
</script>
<style>
  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    background: #111;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  }
  .poster {
    width: 507px;
    min-height: 750px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0d3b4a 0%, #123f52 40%, #0a2f42 70%, #050c14 100%);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: #fff;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .top-credit {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 8.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    padding-top: 10px;
    color: #f0f0f0;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .quotes-zone {
    position: relative;
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0 10px;
  }
  .quotes-left, .quotes-right {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    gap: 22px;
    padding-top: 15px;
    width: 130px;
  }
  .quote {
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.15;
    text-shadow: 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
  }
  .quote-source {
    font-size: 8px;
    font-weight: normal;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .quotes-right {
    align-items: flex-end;
    text-align: right;
  }
  .laurel-placeholder {
    width: 65px;
    height: 65px;
    border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 6.5px;
    color: #ddd;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .center-art {
    width: 100%;
    height: 380px;
    position: absolute;
    top: 60px;
    left: 0;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .castle-placeholder {
    width: 300px;
    height: 380px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    color: #eee;
    font-size: 11px;
    border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
  }
  .title-block {
    position: relative;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0 10px;
    margin-top: 300px;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .title-main {
    font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 42px;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
  }
  .title-sub {
    font-family: 'Brush Script MT', cursive, serif;
    font-size: 26px;
    margin-top: 4px;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .credits-block {
    background: #000;
    padding: 12px 10px 8px 10px;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 15px;
  }
  .credit-line {
    font-size: 7px;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #f2f2f2;
  }
  .credit-line b {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .website {
    font-size: 8px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 8px 0;
    background: #000;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="poster">

  <div class="top-credit">FORK FILMS IN ASSOCIATION WITH CHICAGO MEDIA PROJECT<br>
  Directed by ABIGAIL E. DISNEY and KATHLEEN HUGHES</div>

  <div class="quotes-zone">
    <div class="quotes-left">
      <div class="quote">"A CASE STUDY IN<br>CORPORATE HEARTLESSNESS"
        <div class="quote-source">THE WRAP</div>
      </div>
      <div class="quote">"BLISTERING"
        <div class="quote-source">LOS ANGELES TIMES</div>
      </div>
      <div class="quote">"COMPELLING"
        <div class="quote-source">INDIEWIRE</div>
      </div>
      <div class="quote">"POWERFUL"
        <div class="quote-source">VARIETY</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="quotes-right">
      <div class="quote">"EXTREMELY POWERFUL<br>TIMELY AND IMPORTANT"
        <div class="quote-source">THE HOLLYWOOD REPORTER</div>
      </div>
      <div class="laurel-placeholder">[Laurel: Sundance<br>Official Selection 2022]</div>
      <div class="laurel-placeholder">[Laurel: Hot Docs<br>Official Selection 2022]</div>
      <div class="laurel-placeholder">[Laurel: Mountainfilm<br>Official Selection 2022]</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="center-art">
    <div class="castle-placeholder">[Illustration: Pink castle atop a mountain of green money bags, with a man climbing a ladder toward a figure in a tower window, painted blue/teal textured background]</div>
  </div>

  <div class="title-block">
    <div class="title-main">THE<br>AMERICAN DREAM</div>
    <div class="title-sub">and Other Fairy Tales</div>
  </div>

  <div class="credits-block">
    <div class="credit-line"><b>EXECUTIVE PRODUCERS</b> SUSAN DISNEY LORD, TIM DISNEY, BILL HANEY, PAULA FROEHLE, STEVE COHEN</div>
    <div class="credit-line"><b>DIRECTORS OF PHOTOGRAPHY</b> JEFF HUTCHENS AND JAMES MILLS &nbsp; <b>MUSIC BY</b> AWESOME AND MODEST &nbsp; <b>WRITTEN BY</b> BLAKE LEYH</div>
    <div class="credit-line"><b>CO-PRODUCERS</b> LAUREN WIMBUSH, KAT VECCHIO AND ALEXANDER HYDE</div>
    <div class="credit-line"><b>EDITOR</b> DAVID COHEN &nbsp; <b>PRODUCER</b> AIDEEN KANE &nbsp; <b>DIRECTED AND PRODUCED BY</b> ABIGAIL E. DISNEY AND KATHLEEN HUGHES</div>
  </div>

  <div class="website">WWW.AMERICANDREAMDOC.COM</div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
